    see: ['Immigration and bags take 60 to 90 minutes.', 'Welcome Suica machines are in the arrivals area. Pay cash, load ¥5,000 each, one card per person.', 'The 7-Bank ATM in arrivals takes Indian cards.', 'Switch on the eSIM before leaving the terminal.'],
    story: ['Haneda was Tokyo\'s main international airport until Narita opened in 1978, then won long-haul flights back in 2010. It is one of the busiest airports in the world and famously punctual.', 'Terminal 3 has an Edo-style shopping street, Edo Koji, with wooden facades on the departures level.'],
